95:## 2. App.Core ? ReleaseScanner
96:
97:```csharp
98:public sealed record ReleaseSetInput(string SfvOrRarPath, string RelativeName);
99:public sealed record ReleaseScanResult(
100:    IReadOnlyList<ReleaseSetInput> MainSets,
101:    IReadOnlyList<string> SampleFiles,
102:    IReadOnlyList<string> SubtitleSfvs,       // nested-SRR candidates (pyrescene extra_sfvs)
103:    IReadOnlyList<string> StoredFiles,
104:    IReadOnlyList<string> MusicSfvs,          // detected, unsupported until Spec 2
105:    IReadOnlyList<string> Warnings);
106:
107:public interface IReleaseScanner
108:{
109:    ReleaseScanResult Scan(string releaseRoot, CancellationToken ct = default);
110:}
111:```
112:
113:The classifier is a **line-for-line port of the normative excerpt** ? an ordered decision tree with
114:first-match semantics, not a declarative rule set. *(Finding 3.)* Summary of the tree (excerpt
115:governs; each ported branch cites its excerpt lines in a comment):
116:
117:**2a. Main-set selection (`remove_unwanted_sfvs`)** ? for each `*.sfv` under the root, in order:
118:
119:1. Name contains `vobsub`/`subtitle` and release name lacks `subpack|vobsub|subtitle|sub.pack` ﾐ岱ｸ
120:   **excluded**.
121:2. Name contains `subs`: if the music/multi-CD false-positive regex (`^000?-` or `cd\d`/`flac`) or
122:   a subs-flavored release name matches, **fall through to the remaining checks** (pyrescene's
123:   `pass` ? the SFV is *not* yet accepted); otherwise ﾐ岱ｸ **excluded**. *(Finding 3's `pass` nuance.)*
124:3. Parent dir ﾐ鯛封 exact set {`subs`,`vobsubs`,`vobsub`,`subtitles`,`sub`,`czsubs`,`subpack`,
125:   `vobsubs-full`,`vobsubs-light`,`codec`,`codecs`,`cover`,`covers`} ﾐ岱ｸ **excluded**.
126:4. Parent dir ﾐ鯛封 {`proof`,`proofs`}: pyrescene's proof state machine, ported exactly ? requires the
127:   SFV to list **exactly one entry**; a singleton entry not ending in lowercase `.rar` ﾐ岱ｸ excluded
128:   (proof); otherwise read the RAR's packed-file blocks where the **last** block's image-ness wins
129:   (`skip = True/False` reassignment); RAR5/`ValueError` ﾐ岱ｸ warning + excluded; missing proof RAR ﾐ岱ｸ
130:   warning + excluded. Only `ValueError` is caught ? other I/O exceptions propagate to the
131:   per-item warning handler as **[DIVERGENCE: hardening]** (pyrescene would crash). *(Findings 4, 5.)*
132:5. Directory matches `.*Subs.?CD\d$` ﾐ岱ｸ **excluded**.
133:6. Parent dir *contains* `subpack` (release name doesn't) ﾐ岱ｸ **excluded**; same for `subfix`; same
134:   for `fix`. Substring checks, ordered after the exact-set rule. *(Finding 2.)*
135:7. Otherwise ﾐ岱ｸ **main set**.
136:
137:**Rescue fallback** (excerpt tail): if zero SFVs survived, every SFV with >1 entry or with a
138:music-extension entry (`.mp3/.flac/.mp2`, case-sensitive `endswith` like pyrescene) is re-admitted.
139:**[DIVERGENCE]** re-admitted *music* SFVs go to `MusicSfvs` (Spec 2), not `MainSets`; re-admitted
140:multi-entry RAR SFVs become main sets as in pyrescene. Zero SFVs after rescue ﾐ岱ｸ warning
141:("might be missing an SFV file") + RAR-only discovery (2e).
142:
143:**Excluded-SFV destinations** *(finding 2's destination question, from `generate_srr`; rev 3 ?
144:new-2)*: every excluded SFV (rules 1-6) goes to `SubtitleSfvs` ? pyrescene treats ALL
145:`extra_sfvs` as nested-SRR candidates ? EXCEPT proof-linked SFVs (rule 4: SFV + its RAR ﾐ岱ｸ
146:`StoredFiles`) and SFVs in a `dirfix` subdir (skipped entirely, warning). Additionally, when the
147:release name contains `subpack` or `subfix`, every MAIN SFV is ALSO queued for nested-SRR
148:processing (the excerpt's final block). The nested-SRR pipeline itself (existing wizard step)
149:also stores each subtitle SFV, preserving pyrescene's stored-SFV behavior.
150:
151:**2b. Music detection** *(finding 6; rev 3 ? new-4)*: `has_music` runs ONLY in the zero-survivor
152:rescue, exactly as the excerpt does ? SFVs surviving 2a rules 1-7 are main sets even if they also
153:list music files. In the rescue, music-entry SFVs (case-sensitive `.mp3/.flac/.mp2` `endswith`) ﾐ岱ｸ
154:`MusicSfvs` + warning **[DIVERGENCE: pyrescene admits them as sets; Spec 2 restores that]**.
155:Music-only after rescue ﾐ岱ｸ folder-mode Create disabled. Empty/corrupt SFVs ﾐ岱ｸ warning, stored-only
156:**[DIVERGENCE: hardening ? pyrescene lets parse failures propagate]**.
