322:1. Zero inputs + at least one stored file ﾐ岱ｸ storage-only SRR (header + stored blocks). Zero + zero
323:   ﾐ岱ｸ error result "Nothing to write: no inputs and no stored files."
324:2. Per input, in list order: `.sfv` ﾐ岱ｸ parse entries (reuse the existing SFV line parser), resolve
