326:   sort with `RARVolumeNameComparer.Instance`; an SFV may contain MULTIPLE chains ? all its
327:   volumes are written in sorted order (the comparer groups chains naturally). `.rar` ﾐ岱ｸ walk its
328:   chain (existing logic); if the file is not its chain's first volume ﾐ岱ｸ error result
329:   "'{name}' is not a first RAR volume." (pyrescene ValueError parity).
330:3. Volume block names: `storeRelativePaths ? SrrNameCanonicalizer.CanonicalizeRelative(rootFinal,
331:   volumePath) : Path.GetFileName(volumePath)` where `rootFinal = GetFinalPath(rootFolder)`
